Note on the dataset: data/raw/german.csv is a redistribution of the Statlog
(German Credit Data) dataset, originally donated by Prof. Hans Hofmann and
distributed via the UCI Machine Learning Repository
(DOI: 10.24432/C5NC77). The dataset itself is provided by UCI for research
purposes; please cite Hofmann (1994) and the UCI Machine Learning Repository
if you reuse it.
